---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={"Writing a Game Once and Running It Everywhere: Where Exact Replay Ends and Tolerance Begins"}
  description={"About: Writing a Game Once and Running It Everywhere. Rules and simulation can be replayed exactly under strict arithmetic; rendering across graphics hardware can only agree within a measured tolerance."}
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Research study · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      Writing a Game Once and Running It Everywhere: Where Exact Replay Ends and Tolerance Begins
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      This study asks whether a game can be written once as a checked state machine and then projected into several engines and languages. The answer drawn from the sources: yes for game rules and simulation, under strict numeric discipline; no for bit-exact pixels across graphics hardware, where only tolerance-based agreement is achievable.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">In plain words</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li>The rules of a game (who moves, what collides, who wins) can be stated once and replayed exactly, provided the arithmetic is pinned down.</li>
        <li>The pictures a game draws cannot be made identical on every graphics card. They can be checked to stay within a measured error.</li>
        <li>Today's game description formats each cover one slice. Almost none checks the seams between slices, and that seam is where this design concentrates its effort.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/game-engines/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read → /papers/game-engines/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/game-engines.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
